01030  *  CONVERSION ROUTINE.  INPUT IN ROW BINARY.                         CSC3
01035  *                                                                    CSC3
01040  *  IF SENSE SWITCH C IS ON, OUTPUT IS COLUMN                         CSC3
01050  *  BINARY.  IF OFF, ROW BINARY.  SENSE SWITCH                        CSC3
01060  *  G ON GIVES ROW TO COLUMN CONVERSION WITHOUT                       CSC3
01070  *  CHECKSUM CORRECTION.  SENSE SWITCH F ON                           CSC3
01080  *  REMOVES 9L2 (IGNORE CKSUM) PUNCHES FROM A                         CSC3
01090  *  FORTRAN DECK BEFORE COMPUTING CHECKSUM.                           CSC3
01100  *  CHECKSUM IS NOT COMPUTED IF WORD COUNT                            CSC3
01110  *  (9L13-17) IS ZERO.                                                CSC3
